{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BowmanVSZombies: Kill, Survive, Level Up!</h2><strong> Please take a look at the roadmap to see the next steps for the game, which will be a wave-based and story-driven game.</strong><br><br>Grab your bow, nock your arrows, and fight to survive against waves of nasty zombies, gruesome monsters, and epic bosses who follow the orders of your worst enemy in <strong>Bowman VS Zombies</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870740/extras/6af19d4827ddf0dbc99da2cb7a04f8f8.poster.avif?t=1595099180\" width=660 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870740/extras/6af19d4827ddf0dbc99da2cb7a04f8f8.webm?t=1595099180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870740/extras/6af19d4827ddf0dbc99da2cb7a04f8f8.mp4?t=1595099180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Do your beat to survive by any and all means necessary in the different levels!<br></li><li> Fight against different enemies, each one worse than the others!<br></li><li> Use your skill tree and some in-game powerups to help you fight your enemies.<br></li><li> Compare your skills to your friends with our <strong>online Leaderboard</strong> and <strong>Steam achievements</strong>!<br></li><li> Customize your character, buy new levels and improve your skill tree with our in-game currency system.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870740/extras/21fea8c02c40fd4abf0fb79ee8fc63d8.poster.avif?t=1595099180\" width=660 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870740/extras/21fea8c02c40fd4abf0fb79ee8fc63d8.webm?t=1595099180\